        "sid": "2PE 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa mukachi kawantu mwanyamukili niatuprofwetu akutwamba, nimukachi kenu nawa mwakekala ankuluŋaŋa akutwamba, akaletelamu kwambula kwakukisaŋana kwitiya hambadi, hiyakudikala Mwanta wayilandili, nakudikokela kujilumuka kwaswayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amavulu akalonda muyuma yakubajama yelaŋawu; hansaŋu yawenowu akatena njila yansaŋu yalala chatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akadihetesha kudenu nalwisu, namazu akudimbana; kusompesha kwawu kwakufuma kumwaka hikukulabaku, nikujilumuka kwawu hikukuya namutuluku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi walekeli kwanakena aŋelu havulumwinuwu, hakuyumbila mukaluŋa kachinana nakuyisha mumena amwidima wabwi, kulonda kuyisweka akashiki kukusompesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walekeli kwanakena mpata yamunu mwishina yahashankulu, hakuhemba Nowa mukwakushimuna kuloŋa, nawakwawu atanu nayedi, haleteliyi dibaji mumpata yawantu asekeshelaŋa Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabalumwini nyikala yaSodoma naGomora hiyikwikala kwawuti hohu, hakuyihisha yijilumuki, nakuyilisha chuma chakutalilahu antu akusekesha Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wapulwishili Loti muntu waloŋa, watiyilaŋa kubajama kwawantu atama kumuchima bwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yena muntu waloŋa, chashakaminiyi mukachi kawu nakumona nikutiya, watiyilaŋa kutama nankashi kumuchima windi waloŋa hefuku hefuku, nanyidimu yakuluwalala yakoŋelaŋawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komana Yehova weluka kupulwisha akwakumwakama mukweseka, weluka kusweka abula kuloŋa mukubabesha, akashiki kwifuku dakusompesha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chikuswejela antu endaŋa mwaya chisemwa chaheseki, nakufwila yamajilu, nakudiwula wanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akola hamesu, akeŋa mwaya nyichima yawu, hiyazaalaŋa woma wakutena alema chatamaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutoŋa aŋelu ayibadika kukola niŋovu, hiyayisompeshaŋa nakuyihosha chatama kumesu aYehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila wena adi neyi anyama akadi maana, asemukila yowu kuyikwata nakuyijaha, atenaŋa yuma yabula kwilukawu chatama, akanoŋela mukunoŋa kwawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakutambula wufwetu wanyidimu yawu yatama. Atiyaloŋa kuwaha nakuluŋa namwa ana; himahuji namabeka, aluŋaŋa kumawijawu akukeŋaŋana, hadyaloŋawu nanenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akweti mesu asweja wuvumbi; abulaŋa kutwesha kuleka nshidi; akokolaŋa akwawu azeya munyichima; akweti nyichima yenjilila lwisu; hiyakwakushiŋewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anashiyi njila yaloŋa, anapwapuki, analondi njila yaBalami mwana kaBeyori, wakeŋa eli wufwetu wakuluwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakumukonkolola namuloŋa windi, chimbulu wakahoshaŋa nakuhosha nezu damuntu, hakulekesha kwandala kwaandeliyi yena kaprofwetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hituseloki twakadi meji, himbundu yalelokaŋa nampepela yaŋovu; wena diwu anaswekeluwu mwidima wamukaluŋa wiyila bwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chahoshaŋawu mazu akuhemesha akudisamba, hiyakukoka antu nakufwila kwatama kwachisemwa chaheseki nikubajama; antu anakeŋi kupuluka mudi awa ashakama mukuluwaŋesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayikanaŋa nawu mukufuma muwuduŋu, kutoŋa awenawu hiyanduŋu jakutoka muloŋa neyi muntu anamwimiki mushindu kudi mukwawu, neli dehi nduŋu yanowu namwimiki mushindu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa antu anapuluki dehi kumajilu ampata yamunu mwishina, nanochu chanamwilukuwu Mwanta, yowu Chamwinu Yesu Kristu, neyi akuyikasamu cheŋi ayimika mushindu, kukuminina kwawu kukubadika kutama hadiŋuwu hakusambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi abulili kwiluka njila yakuloŋa mutenowu dihu; Ilaŋa chatama chakwila wena ayiluka dehi, hela, kwamuntu wumuku hiyakufuntamu nakushiya kuleja kwajila kwayilejeluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneli mwaya chishimu ichi chalala chakwila nawu, Kawa nafuntili cheŋi masanjilindi, Yishi nimukaji waŋulu anawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
